gametitle=Burnout 3: Takedown [SLUS-21050] (U)


//  how to edit the cheat if u want (edit the value of these lines)
//    001ECAC0  shadow tint, 0x00BBGGRR, HALF of the colour you want (0 = black)
//    001ECAC4  shadow strength: 0 = measured on each track (default), or 1 to 0x40 to
//              force a fixed value everywhere (0x20 leaves the road at half light,
//              0x40 is the darkest the hardware allows)
//    001ECAC8  shadow shortening, float (3F000000 = 0.5; 3F800000 = no shortening)
//    001ECACC  traffic range in metres, float, measured from the camera as |dx|+|dz|
//              (42200000 = 40 m default; 41F00000 = 30; 42700000 = 60; 0 = no
//              traffic shadows at all)
//    001ECAD0  maximum traffic shadows per frame (8 by default)
//    001ECAD4  traffic distance that still gets the road-clipped shadow, float
//              (41A00000 = 20 m default; 42200000 = 40 m = best looking, costs more)
//    001EC9E0  ground light: fraction of the track's sun level at which the shadow
//              fades out completely, float (3F051EB8 = 0.52)
//    001EC9E4  ground light: fraction at which the shadow reaches full strength,
//              float (3F3851EC = 0.72; raise it towards 1.0 to make the shadow
//              lighter over ground that is only partly shaded)

